																		SCP-3675: The Void Called
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3072585); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3072585&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606509487" alt="Modulum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3072585)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modulum" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3072585); return false;" >Modulum</a></span> <span class="odate time_1515211668 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">06 Jan 2018 04:07</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3674925">
									

<blockquote>
<p><em>&quot;We stand upon the brink of a precipice. We peer into the abyss—we grow sick and dizzy. Our first impulse is to shrink away from the danger. Unaccountably we remain&#8230; it is but a thought, although a fearful one, and one which chills the very marrow of our bones with the fierceness of the delight of its horror. It is merely the idea of what would be our sensations during the sweeping precipitancy of a fall from such a height&#8230; for this very cause do we now the most vividly desire it.”</em><br />
&#8212;Edgar Allan Poe, &quot;The Imp of the Perverse&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p><em>if your grave doesnt say &quot;rest in peace&quot; on it you are automatically drafted into the skeleton war</em><br />
&#8212;wint (@dril)</p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<p>Lurked three years, started a subreddit, and after more than eight months of work, my first SCP. There were many moving parts and plot elements to this that were difficult to get right, and virtually none of the words you read here are the same as my first draft of this. This piece is my take on a very personal sort of horror - one without any external threats or monsters, built purely out of what lies within humanity itself and nothing else.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(361873); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=361873&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1515257510" alt="Photosynthetic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=361873)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(361873); return false;">Photosynthetic</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1515257510" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tretter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1422059); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1422059&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1515257510" alt="tretter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1422059)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tretter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1422059); return false;">tretter</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theesherm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1583637); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1583637&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1515257510" alt="TheeSherm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1583637)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/theesherm" onc